  "releaseNotes": "✨ Improvements\n    - Improved public APIs to simplify usage and enhance developer experience.\n    - Enhanced HTML conversion engine with better accuracy and structure mapping.\n\n  🐞 Bug Fixes\n    - Fixed multiple logical issues across the document processing pipeline.\n    - Improved overall stability and correctness.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
